{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely explore the open campus world and spend your four-year student life. As a member of the Game Development Club, grow into a qualified game developer alongside your club members.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in campus events, complete academic courses, earn living expenses and tuition fees, navigate campus survival, and graduate successfully;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classrooms, dorms, shops, clubs... Engage with diverse environments where day-night cycles and seasonal changes dynamically reshape the world over time;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather game design inspiration from daily life, collaborate with club members, and collectively complete game development projects;</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance personal skills, encounter diverse characters on broader stages, and explore the campus's layered past and unfolding future.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3373480?t=1747965716","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747965716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373480/52adf5d462a17a23c255ef77a16fc9826112f3b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747965716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373480/52adf5d462a17a23c255ef77a16fc9826112f3b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747965716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely explore the open campus world and spend your four-year student life. As a member of the Game Development Club, grow into a qualified game developer alongside your club members.</p><u